  Singapore Pattern (Dev utopia, Western dystopia): 18% of runs
  Norway Pattern (West/Dev utopia, Eco dystopia): 8% of runs
  Bhutan Pattern (Eco/Indigenous utopia, Dev dystopia): 2% of runs

