  MemeticEvolutionPhase,  // P2.6 (Oct 16, 2025): Memetic Evolution & Polarization Dynamics
  ConsciousnessGovernancePhase,  // TIER 2C (Oct 17, 2025): Digital Consciousness Governance Preparedness
